-### Lead-Capture Flow (The One Real Revenue Path)
-**Endpoint:** `POST /api/leads`  
-**Form:** Quote request form on landing page → validates with Zod → calls `/api/leads`
-
-**Current behavior:**
-```
-Visitor submits form
-  ↓
-Client-side Zod validation
-  ↓
-POST /api/leads (with Zod re-validation)
-  ↓
-✅ ALWAYS logged to Vercel (durable, recoverable from logs)
-  ├─ BEST-EFFORT: Prisma DB write (requires DATABASE_URL)
-  ├─ BEST-EFFORT: Admin email (requires RESEND_API_KEY or SMTP)
