-### P0.3 — NextAuth Secret (Third Priority)
-**Objective:** Secure session signing; disable default insecure fallback  
-**Why:** Default secret is a debug placeholder; production must use a strong random value.
-
-**Action:**
-1. Generate strong secret:
-   ```bash
-   openssl rand -base64 32
-   ```
-   (or use https://generate-secret.vercel.app/32)
-2. Set in Vercel:
-   ```
-   NEXTAUTH_SECRET = <your-generated-secret>
-   NEXTAUTH_URL = https://ecowoods-app.vercel.app
-   ```
-
-**Success metric:** NextAuth initializes without console warnings  
-**Estimated effort:** 5 minutes
-
