-## 5. Risk Register & Mitigation
-
-| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation | Owner |
-|------|-------------|--------|-----------|-------|
-| Database outage → silent lead loss | Medium | 🔴 Critical | Durable logging + monitoring. Leads persist to Vercel logs even if DB fails. | DevOps |
-| Email delivery failure → owner unaware of leads | High | 🔴 Critical | Webhook + n8n fallback. Rate-limit email retries. | DevOps |
-| Spam form submissions (no rate limit + no CAPTCHA) | High | 🟠 High | Implement rate limit (P0.5). Add honeypot. Optionally add hCaptcha. | Engineer |
-| API key exposure in source (Unsplash) | High | 🟠 High | Move to env. Rotate exposed key. Add secret scanning to CI. | DevOps |
-| Weak NEXTAUTH_SECRET in production | Medium | 🟠 High | Generate cryptographically strong secret. Rotate quarterly. | DevOps |
-| Mobile apps orphaned (dual Expo apps, no clear owner) | Medium | 🟡 Medium | Consolidate or delete. Mobile is post-MVP. | Engineering Lead |
-| FastAPI backend undeployed, unmaintained | Low | 🟡 Medium | Archive or commit to deploy timeline. If archive, delete from repo. | Leadership |
-| No Web CI → broken deployments | Medium | 🟡 Medium | Add typecheck + build + smoke test CI. Block failed PRs. | Engineer |
-| Dependency vulnerabilities (pnpm, Next.js, Prisma) | High | 🟡 Medium | Weekly `pnpm outdated`. Automated Dependabot. | DevOps |
-| No error tracking → silent failures in production | Medium | 🟡 Medium | Integrate Sentry. Set up error alerts. | DevOps |
