-
-## Verification Steps
-
-### 1. Local Testing
-
-```bash
-# Start dev server
-pnpm dev
-
-# Submit test pilot lead (FloorForge page or curl)
-curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/pilot-leads \
-  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
-  -d '{
-    "name": "Jane Contractor",
-    "email": "jane@example.com",
-    "phone": "(416) 555-1234",
