-`globals.css:3019-3036`: `#1e40af`, `#854d0e`, `#991b1b`, `#166534`, `#5b21b6`,
-`#4b5563`, `#c2410c`, `#0c4a6e`. Off-brand (blue/purple/grey on a
-copper-and-cream site) and not theme-aware — these are fixed in both themes.
