-### F-12 · Two form controls sit at 14px — Safari will auto-zoom
-
-**Evidence:** `audit/scripts/ios-zoom-audit.mjs`. Root font-size is the browser
-default 16px (`html` sets no `font-size`), so `--fs-sm` = 0.875rem = **14px**.
