-|---|---|---|
-| axe violations | 133 cells | **103** |
-| horizontal overflow | 16 → 2 | **2** (`/products/floorforge` @320, +4px) |
-| form control under 16px | 0 | **0** |
-| WCAG target < 24px | 134 | 134 |
-
-`/blog`, `/case-studies` and `/service-areas` are now clean in light at most
