-
-| URL | responds |
-| --- | --- |
-| `https://www.ecowoodshardwood.com/` | **200 — a live page** |
-| every deep path tested (7 of them) | **404** |
-
-Worse than either failure alone:
-
-- A **second live homepage** for the same business competes with ecowoods.ca for
